                    AspisR1.FIv_NativeValue.decode power * AspisR1.FIv_NativeValue.decode lambda ^ i) ∧
                AspisR1.FIv_NativeValue.decode next =
                  AspisR1.FIv_NativeValue.decode power * AspisR1.FIv_NativeValue.decode lambda ^ n
